ope</link><description>在一次将其提升到更高高度的任务失败后，斯威夫特天文台将在几个月后重新进入地球大气层&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasa-calls-off-rescue-effort-to-save-doomed-telescope.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 23:50:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nasa-calls-off-rescue-effort-to-save-doomed-telescope</guid></item><item><title>伊博加因第一科学家：“特朗普关于伊博加因的决定改变了一切！”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/no-1-ibogaine-scientist-trumps-decision-on-ibogaine-changes-everything</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 23:35:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/no-1-ibogaine-scientist-trumps-decision-on-ibogaine-changes-everything</guid></item><item><title>美国新型人形机器人瞄准家务活 标价 1,688 美元</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/new-us-humanoid-robot-targets-house-chores-with-1688-price-tag</link><description>Nor Robotics 售价 1,688 美元的 Nori A3 带来了价格实惠的家庭自动化产品，具有轮式设计和适合日常家务任务的技能。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-us-humanoid-robot-targets-house-chores-with-1688-price-tag.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 23:20:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/new-us-humanoid-robot-targets-house-chores-with-1688-price-tag</guid></item><item><title>人类大脑在四个不同的年龄进行自我重组</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-human-brain-reorganizes-itself-at-four-distinct-ages</link><description>一项针对 4,000 多人脑部扫描的大型研究确定了大脑结构网络改变其发育轨迹的四个不同年龄。这些转折点将人类生活分为五个独特的拓扑变化时代。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-human-brain-reorganizes-itself-at-four-distinct-ages.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 23:05:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-human-brain-reorganizes-itself-at-four-distinct-ages</guid></item><item><title>扩大用于急救人员的自主人工智能无人机的生产</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/production-of-autonomous-ai-drone-for-first-responders-to-be-scaled-up</link><description>世界上第一架专为急救人员设计的自主人工智能无人机的生产规模将扩大。为此，完全自主无人机系统开发商 DefendEye 宣布完成由 NovaCapital 牵头的一轮重大投资。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/production-of-autonomous-ai-drone-for-first-responders-to-be-scaled-up2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 22:50:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/production-of-autonomous-ai-drone-for-first-responders-to-be-scaled-up</guid></item><item><title>根据最近的进化发现，重新思考我们如何命名和分类人类祖先</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/rethinking-how-we-name-and-classify-our-human-ancestors-following-recent-evolutionary-discoveries</link><description>莫纳什大学的最新研究表明，我们对人类进化的理解的最新进展挑战了我们目前对祖先的命名和分类方式。这项发表在《美国生物人类学杂志》上的研究认为，我们需要重新思考，并建议将人类的所有物种以及我们在过去 4-500 万年里生活过的密切相关的化石亲戚重新分类为人属的一部分。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/rethinking-how-we-name-and-classify-our-human-ancestors-following-recent-evolutionary-discoveries2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 22:35:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/rethinking-how-we-name-and-classify-our-human-ancestors-following-recent-evolutionary-discoveries</guid></item><item><title>Comcast Xfinity 希望将您的 Wi-Fi 用作家中的运动传感器</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/comcast-xfinity-wants-to-use-your-wi-fi-as-a-motion-sensor-in-your-home</link><description>康卡斯特周一&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/comcast-xfinity-wants-to-use-your-wi-fi-as-a-motion-sensor-in-your-home2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 22:20:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/comcast-xfinity-wants-to-use-your-wi-fi-as-a-motion-sensor-in-your-home</guid></item></channel></rss>